'''Fedora Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from sending [[Gamatoto Expedition|Gamatoto]] on a [[Gamatoto Expedition#Event|unique expedition]] during the [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]]. It was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

